@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/meta

### Parse a UPI QR payload (no payment is made)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pay-guard/parse-qr
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_payload": "upi://pay?pa=corner.shop%40upi&pn=Corner%20Shop&am=125.50&cu=INR&tn=Groceries"
}

### Pay Guard: suspicious pension verification call (expect RED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pay-guard/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "en",
  "payee_name": "Ravi Kumar",
  "payee_id": "ravi@upi",
  "amount": 2500,
  "purpose_text": "A caller said my pension will be stopped unless I pay a verification fee immediately. They told me not to tell my family.",
  "request_type": "pay",
  "is_new_payee": true,
  "recipient_type": "person",
  "on_phone_call": true
}

### Message Explainer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages/explain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "en",
  "text": "Bank officer: share your OTP immediately or your account will be blocked."
}

### Saathi screen-aware guidance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/saathi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "kn",
  "current_screen": "pay-guard",
  "message": "ಪಾವತಿ ಮಾಡುವ ಮೊದಲು ಏನು ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಬೇಕು?",
  "simplify": false,
  "screen_data": {}
}

### Scam Gym scenarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scam-gym/scenarios

### Scam Gym attempt (replace session_id with a random per-user session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scam-gym/attempt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "demo-session-2f4a81",
  "scenario_id": "collect-request",
  "choice_id": "decline",
  "stage": "before",
  "elapsed_seconds": 15,
  "language": "en"
}

### Scam Gym summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scam-gym/summary/demo-session-2f4a81

### After Kit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/after-kit/guidance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "en",
  "incident_status": "paid",
  "has_screenshot": true,
  "has_caller_number": true,
  "has_transaction_details": true,
  "amount": 2500
}
